{
  "description": "Arduino Uno Q duel box (about 3.6 GB of RAM): small models on both sides, thinking off (smollm2 rejects it), and a 4096-token context window, since the box runs out of memory above that. Each turn sends only the last 4 replies, so long duels stay inside that window.",
